title: A file with unsaved text that another program changes: Save mine writes what is on the card, and Cancel before it writes nothing
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
forbid-log: WARN.*script
expect-file: edit-odd/a.txt :: (?-i)\AMINE
expect-log: saved .*a\.txt

wait 3000
goto a.txt
wait 800
edit a.txt 1 1
type MINE
touch a.txt THEIRS
wait 2500
key save
wait 800
answer Cancel
wait 600
mark cancelled-still-unsaved
wait 400
key save
wait 800
answer Save mine
wait 1200
mark mine-saved
wait 400
quit
